synopsis: "Unix transport for the CometBFT JSON-RPC client"
description: """
Cardano's and Tron's arrangement: this is Cosmos_rpc_flow.Make applied to a
Unix file descriptor and nothing else, so the Unix path and the unikernel
path are the same implementation with a different flow underneath.

The guarded live-network executable ships in this package: it is the only
thing here that signs with a real key and touches a network, and it needs a
Unix transport to do either."""
